%%{init: {'theme':'default', 'flowchart': {'nodeSpacing': 35, 'rankSpacing': 28}}}%%
flowchart TD
    Start([Customer wants to call the CSP again about the same ticket]) --> Dial[Opens phone call log · Taps the saved Wiom IVR Masked number]
    Dial --> Recognise[IVR recognises the customer and finds exactly 1 active ticket]
    Recognise --> Bridge[Bridges directly to the CSP · No PIN needed]
    Bridge --> Pick{CSP picks up?}
    Pick -->|Yes| Connect[Both parties talk · Call recorded]
    Pick -->|No| Missed[Customer hears 'call not picked']

    classDef start fill:#e0e7ff,stroke:#4338ca,color:#312e81
    classDef good fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d
    classDef neutral fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f
    class Start start
    class Connect good
    class Missed neutral
